# Agent-harness scratch worktrees. NOT ignorable as bare `.claude/` — commands/,
# skills/ and settings.json under it are tracked project config. Untracked dirt
# here is load-bearing: the commit contract fails ANY run that reports done with
# a dirty tree, and non-code runs (librarian, analyst) use the main checkout as
# their workdir — so one stray untracked path fails every such run and sends its
# task round the rework loop. Seen live 2026-09-07 (librarian run 465).
.claude/worktrees/
